# Every text file is LF, both in the repository and on checkout.
#
# The repository was already all-LF; the problem was the checkout side. With
# Windows' core.autocrlf=true and no rules here, Git rewrites files to CRLF as
# it writes them, while Biome's formatter expects LF — so `npm run check` fails
# on files nobody edited, and 15 files sit permanently "modified" with an empty
# content diff. `eol=lf` overrides autocrlf for this repo and stops both.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never inspected, never converted.
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
